## Component Patterns

### Button

```tsx
<button className="rounded-sm bg-primary px-4 py-2 font-medium text-background transition-colors hover:bg-primary/90 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50">
  Click me
</button>

<button className="rounded-sm border border-outline px-4 py-2 hover:bg-hover">
  Secondary
</button>
```

### Card

```tsx
<div className="overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-surface shadow-md">
  <div className="p-6">
    <h2 className="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface">Card Title</h2>
    <p className="text-on-surface-variant">Card content goes here.</p>
  </div>
</div>
```

### Form Input

```tsx
<div className="space-y-2">
  <label htmlFor="email" className="block text-sm font-medium text-on-surface">
    Email
  </label>
  <input
    type="email"
    id="email"
    className="w-full rounded-sm border border-outline bg-surface-elevated px-3 py-2 text-on-surface focus:border-transparent focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary focus:outline-none"
    placeholder="you@example.com"
  />
  <p className="text-sm text-muted">We'll never share your email.</p>
</div>
```

## State Variants

### Hover, Focus, Active

```tsx
<button className="bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 active:bg-primary/80 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary">
  Interactive Button
</button>

<a href="#" className="text-secondary hover:text-secondary/80 hover:underline">
  Link
</a>
```

### Group Hover

```tsx
<div className="group">
  <img src="/image.jpg" className="transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-75" />
  <p className="group-hover:text-primary">Hover the container</p>
</div>
```

### Disabled

```tsx
<button className="disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" disabled>
  Disabled Button
</button>
```

## Dark Mode

```css
@import "tailwindcss";

@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    /* Or use class-based: .dark */
}
```

```tsx
<div className="bg-background text-on-surface dark:bg-background dark:text-on-surface">
  <h1 className="text-on-surface">Title</h1>
  <p className="text-on-surface-variant">Description</p>
</div>
```

NovelGuard default is dark; prefer `dark:` variants for light-mode overrides when both themes ship.

## Custom Styles

### Arbitrary Values

Use sparingly — prefer `@theme` tokens from DESIGN.md.

```tsx
<div className="top-[117px]" />
<div className="grid-cols-[228px_1fr]" /> {/* sidebar width per DESIGN.md */}
```

### @apply Directive

```css
.btn-primary {
  @apply rounded-sm bg-primary px-4 py-2 font-medium text-background;
  @apply hover:bg-primary/90 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary focus:outline-none;
  @apply disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50;
}
```

Prefer utility classes in JSX over `@apply` when possible.

## Configuration

### Tailwind v4: CSS-First Configuration

Extend `@theme` in `globals.css` — see **NovelGuard @theme** above. Keep in sync with [DESIGN.md](mdc:DESIGN.md) front matter; run `python scripts/sync_design_tokens.py --check` when Qt tokens change.

### Tailwind v3 Config (Still Supported)

```javascript
module.exports = {
  content: ["./app/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}", "./components/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}"],
  theme: {
    extend: {
      colors: {
        background: "#121212",
        surface: "#1e1e1e",
        primary: "#bb86fc",
      },
      fontFamily: {
        sans: ["Pretendard", "Noto Sans KR", "Segoe UI", "sans-serif"],
      },
    },
  },
  plugins: [require("@tailwindcss/forms"), require("@tailwindcss/typography")],
};
```

